{"task_id": "Mbpp/87", "solution": "def merge_dictionaries_three(dict1: dict, dict2: dict, dict3: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges three dictionaries into a single dictionary, with later dictionaries\n    overwriting values for duplicate keys (rightmost precedence).\n    \"\"\"\n    merged_dict = {}\n    merged_dict.update(dict1)\n    merged_dict.update(dict2)\n    merged_dict.update(dict3)\n    return merged_dict"}
